### Netcup SCP API — Miscellaneous
# Health checks, maintenance status, and API specification endpoints.
# Most of these do NOT require authentication.

### Ping
# Check if the SCP API is available (no auth required)
GET https://www.servercontrolpanel.de/scp-core/api/ping

### Get Maintenance Information
# Returns maintenance window information for the system
GET {{base_url}}/maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get OpenAPI Specification
# Returns the OpenAPI 3.0.3 spec (no auth required)
GET {{base_url}}/openapi

### MCP Server
# SCP OpenAPI Spec MCP Server endpoint
POST {{base_url}}/openapi/mcp
